      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Zero separation is organized by progressively coarser controls: Gram-point signs attempt interval-by-interval bracketing, paired failures preserve a nearby aggregate count, Rosser blocks relax the match to block scale, and the discrepancy S(t) records accumulated argument variation that can be read from ordered X-ray crossings; the proposed many-line coils are a heuristic geometric extrapolation of unbounded positive S.",
